{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d98f865d-e49b-41f3-a4a3-da3d2a2918a8",
    "name": "PDF Processor API - Complete Collection",
    "description": "Complete Postman collection for testing the PDF Processor API with OCR and encryption capabilities.\n\nThis API processes PDF pay slips by:\n1. Splitting PDFs into individual pages\n2. Using OCR to extract employee information (matricule, nom, prénom)\n3. Renaming files based on extracted data and period\n4. Encrypting all processed files for security\n5. Organizing files by employee ID in folder structure\n\nBase URL: http://localhost:8001\n\nWorkflow:\n1. Upload PDF via POST /process\n2. Poll GET /task/{task_id} until status is 'Completed'\n3. Get folder structure via GET /folders or GET /download/{task_id}\n4. List files in specific employee folder via GET /list_files/{employee_id}\n5. Access encrypted files via GET /secure_file/{employee_id}/{filename}\n\nSecurity: All processed files are encrypted (.enc extension) and can only be accessed through the secure_file endpoint which decrypts them on-the-fly.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "21858758"
  },
